            "title": "Day 1: Thursday, May 15, 2025 - Shinjuku Arrival & Gardens",
            "details": "**Morning:** Arrive in Tokyo, check into your accommodation in Shinjuku or Shibuya.\n**Afternoon:** Shinjuku Gyoen National Garden - Enjoy a peaceful stroll through this beautiful imperial garden.\n**Late Afternoon:** Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building - Head to the free observation decks for panoramic views of Tokyo.\n**Evening:** Dinner in Shinjuku. Explore Shinjuku Golden Gai or Omoide Yokocho (Piss Alley) for a glimpse into traditional Tokyo nightlife and small eateries."
          },
          {
            "title": "Day 2: Friday, May 16, 2025 - Shibuya Icons & Views",
            "details": "**Morning:** Shibuya Crossing & Hachiko Statue - Experience the iconic scramble crossing and meet the famous loyal dog statue.\n**Afternoon:** Shibuya Sky - Ascend to the rooftop observation deck for breathtaking 360-degree views of the city. Explore Shibuya Center Gai for trendy shops.\n**Evening:** Dinner in Shibuya. Enjoy shopping around Shibuya 109 and other department stores."
          },
          {
            "title": "Day 3: Saturday, May 17, 2025 - Shinjuku Shopping & Culture",
            "details": "**Morning:** Shinjuku Shopping Spree - Explore major department stores like Isetan, Takashimaya Times Square, and Lumine EST.\n**Afternoon:** Samurai Museum (optional) - Immerse yourself in the history of the samurai. Alternatively, explore the quieter side streets of Shinjuku.\n**Evening:** Dinner in Shinjuku. Discover the vibrant atmosphere of Kabukicho."
          },
          {
            "title": "Day 4: Sunday, May 18, 2025 - Harajuku Fashion & Meiji Jingu",
            "details": "**Morning:** Meiji Jingu Shrine - Visit this serene Shinto shrine dedicated to Emperor Meiji and Empress Shoken.\n**Afternoon:** Harajuku Exploration - Dive into Takeshita Street for quirky fashion and sweets, then stroll Omotesando for upscale boutiques.\n**Evening:** Dinner in Harajuku or return to Shibuya/Shinjuku."
          },
          {
            "title": "Day 5: Monday, May 19, 2025 - Modern Art & Departure Prep",
            "details": "**Morning:** TeamLab Planets TOKYO (Toyosu) - Experience an immersive digital art museum. (Note: This requires a short train ride. Book tickets in advance.)\n**Afternoon:** Last-minute Souvenir Shopping & Packing in Shinjuku or Shibuya.\n**Evening:** Farewell Dinner - Enjoy a final memorable meal."
          }
        ],
